"/cxx -gall -pt -O0 -w0 -use_ld_input=.so_files"  instead of putting
it in the middle of the compile line. (Initially, it was after -Is,
-Ls and couple of -Ds.) Also, I removed -lpthread -xti and -rt
libraries that I was linking with.

